<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Fendi Violin Case</title>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@400;600&family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
  body{
    margin:0;
    background:#0b0b0b;
    color:#eaeaea;
    font-family:'Playfair Display', serif;
    scroll-behavior:smooth;
  }

  nav{
    position:fixed;
    top:0;
    width:100%;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    gap:26px;
    padding:14px;
    background:rgba(11,11,11,0.75);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    font-size:12px;
    letter-spacing:2px;
    z-index:10;
  }

  nav a{
    color:#d4af37;
    text-decoration:none;
  }

  section{
    height:100vh;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:center;
    text-align:center;
    padding:40px;
  }

  h1,h2{
    font-family:'Cinzel', serif;
    letter-spacing:3px;
    margin:0;
  }

  h1{
    font-size:60px;
    color:#d4af37;
  }

  h2{
    font-size:34px;
    color:#d4af37;
  }

  p{
    max-width:680px;
    line-height:1.8;
    color:#cfcfcf;
  }

  .tag{
    color:#d4af37;
    letter-spacing:2px;
    font-size:13px;
    margin-top:10px;
  }

  .image{
    width:80%;
    max-width:720px;
    height:380px;
    border:1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.25);
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    color:#777;
    margin-top:30px;
    transition:0.4s;
  }

  .image:hover{
    border-color:#d4af37;
    transform:scale(1.01);
  }

  .btn{
    display:inline-block;
    padding:14px 30px;
    margin-top:20px;
    border:1px solid #d4af37;
    color:#d4af37;
    text-decoration:none;
    transition:0.4s;
  }

  .btn:hover{
    background:#d4af37;
    color:#0b0b0b;
  }

  .fade{
    opacity:0;
    transform:translateY(40px);
    transition:1s ease;
  }

  .fade.show{
    opacity:1;
    transform:translateY(0);
  }

  /* subtle glow */
  .glow{
    text-shadow:0 0 18px rgba(212,175,55,0.2);
  }
</style>
</head>

<body>

<!-- NAV -->
<nav>
  <a href="#home">HOME</a>
  <a href="#story">STORY</a>
  <a href="#craft">CRAFT</a>
  <a href="#handmade">HANDMADE</a>
  <a href="#order">ORDER</a>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<section id="home">
  <div class="fade glow">
    <h1>FENDI</h1>
    <p class="tag">VIOLIN CASE · BLACK GOLD · PURE HANDMADE</p>
    <p>Where craftsmanship becomes silence</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- STORY -->
<section id="story">
  <div class="fade">
    <h2>STORY</h2>
    <p>
      這不是工業產品，而是一件被時間塑造的物件。  
      每一道痕跡，都來自手，而非機器。
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CRAFT -->
<section id="craft">
  <div class="fade">
    <h2>CRAFT</h2>
    <p>
      義大利牛皮手工裁切 × 金屬細節逐件拋光 × 非量產結構
    </p>

    <div class="image">
      MATERIAL · HAND FINISH DETAIL
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- HANDMADE CORE -->
<section id="handmade">
  <div class="fade">
    <h2>PURE HANDMADE</h2>
    <p>
      每一只琴盒皆由工匠逐件製作，非機械批量生產。  
      皮革張力、縫線密度、結構校準皆依個體調整。
    </p>

    <p style="color:#d4af37; margin-top:20px;">
      ⟡ No mass production<br>
      ⟡ No identical pieces<br>
      ⟡ Each case is unique
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ORDER -->
<section id="order">
  <div class="fade">
    <h2 class="glow">NT$ 38,000</h2>
    <p>Handmade limited production · For professional musicians</p>

    <a class="btn" href="https://line.me/ti/p/fendi-chang">
      REQUEST ORDER
    </a>

    <p style="margin-top:20px; font-size:13px; color:#999;">
      LINE: fendi-chang ｜ IG: ssuyuan_chang_fendi ｜ FB: 張絲媛
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  const items = document.querySelectorAll('.fade');

  function show(){
    const vh = window.innerHeight;

    items.forEach(el=>{
      const top = el.getBoundingClientRect().top;
      if(top < vh - 80){
        el.classList.add('show');
      }
    });
  }

  window.addEventListener('scroll', show);
  window.addEventListener('load', show);
</script>

</body>
</html>
